Would make sense implement SWIRE "support" (which is here NO-OP)?

I guess device-tree should document that SWIRE is used, even when kernel doesn't 
have to do anything?

e.g. something like - into the device DT?

&pmi8998_labibb {
        qcom,swire-control;
};

David

